    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22874353ce33d4e27cf89b46",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "商店街的各位",
      "source_fingerprint": "71bc0e079f307427d8ad41c29785c279a2cfe56baa0544a6c0001c8c19f9ebd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14bdd4e6921741fb1c5ef173",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "内恰──！\n恭喜你──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af94f00231882c605413817c13921298baf42086bf7736cbb1fbac3a8b586164",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6258bfbd80d1d567c1920564",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "商店街的人A",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed5448b1ed6306f10d36bb440e0eed7c04ba916ebb08091bd6dfea6416c49b17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d26eb45a335ef7aaea0668",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是这样，就是这个！这个啦！\n我就是想看到你在这样的舞台上跑赢啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a2c09b2f1cc4fb2237b27ccbeb2c8c5456d0e0d4a4e840d19cd8bbb2ffe90cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3664318c9ee9e2a1d1a46ce2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・有马的胜者是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a82582eb4635f14c6d3d93fa6878511c654a4b4017ebca2d1e36e30907add55a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060318.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f52590ad08c030facd39f219",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与总是习惯讽刺自己的\n优秀素质展开了训练的日常。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c795e263deb7e6ac522faed7a9067db0381b2b81d3811e323d3683a034bc1383",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88d9452d7424e1a48425175c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然她没有傲人的独特才能，\n但她展现了能与摩耶重炮、东海帝王\n这些强者们抗衡的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be3f9648aa935fe1bdb5ed4a3c276e9ebb63034fd35b835e67c9edef5c764497",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b855cf80d95fb29b2561ac92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，她无法利落地获得第一名也是事实。\n她自己也相当介意这件事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0adb5b6b0df4e64bce2340b5e0066788b91d1481271d5f7e79d011eb564b02fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:156dae963fe92dab1dfdfff6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，她仍朝着“想要闪闪发光”的梦想\n持续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05a646325cae270bb3d61e2bc348d9c3f45b66cd411260f43b657af584f1a1ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:631894a95a63faee5eac648b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a26dd4d6cd891c52000102428e8f8c5afbd63ed0371e200d7abf1fb8a5f53d39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf0fc3772d584144f447faf0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "假日……来到商店街购物的训练员\n遇到正在与店家阿姨亲切地\n聊着天的优秀素质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "129a06ec007deb4f96552671c4da739592a4d2230824b851955af608070ae97b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ec454dab4ae31a015764b69",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在陪训练员买完东西回去的路上，\n她颇有感触地说，\n有商店街大家的加油，自己就会提起干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d80839cf5fc7a1749601bead761675f32f24677f4fd76ae53e80ca30bbcf27a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70debd2dd7911352ea53018f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "多管闲事的家人们",
      "source_fingerprint": "06956f58c47c447cd83de368bb172c447090d2aad2126a6ca96d6cb0aacccbbb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6123935dd2ed2b6ab57d6f24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即将参赛“小仓纪念”的优秀素质，\n看到东海帝王的光芒，\n不禁变得意志消沉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c29723f173a9554dac8685ea41715c7d8670a257cab50330cab673230a609910",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1ca331154849b41864bf70d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让优秀素质恢复精神，\n训练员带她来到小仓的商店街，\n与当地民众交流。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a677f53b32ecd11cbd8affa625fa3becc684266991e181ab102b710d7e375f24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:867a1f804ce5aeb4d83b3956",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟人们互相交流后，\n优秀素质的确如同训练员的期待，\n顺利地重新整理好心情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "685f2e19e17c9c853a7ed54e3e0637f25f25e7d46f9645d9480e61aa443fb3f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f5bf34f81f56f6f5de0a426",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让我振奋的事物",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec0703abbd6a0f775033012db70b87ef071195b929082c6b8cbf0b24b9c27258",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:574bbb90c8ca96f4953097ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在为了有马纪念不断进行训练的某一天，\n优秀素质看见东海帝王\n努力复健的身影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dcf4b27360f065fac1e9d23a7ef2c1125d056e881cb88012701cf8f7330a63a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b8f326be72792116e84e06",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论身处何种状况她都坚持努力不懈。\n但受伤当下她仍因不甘心而流下了泪水。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e37e703695241ffa398cb54a1c754f421e8d6ae2936d3e572bd7c5497d1a66c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb21046b447ece2054889172",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质察觉自己跟她的差距，\n就在于是否能够靠自己\n再次站起来──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e8d81ebe090e6b61534ffbbad37bd34ce347bd33f5075b9eb0b8a5d6c7f5988",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1060/storytimeline_501060403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    }
  ]
}
